{
  "uid": "otel-playground",
  "title": "OpenTelemetry Playground",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "tags": [
    "learning",
    "opentelemetry"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "traceId",
        "label": "TraceID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "実験の進め方",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "① 操作画面でAPIを呼ぶ → ② 約10〜15秒待ってグラフを見る → ③ TraceIDを上の入力欄に貼り、下のトレースを見る。\n\n**Aだけ遅い**：Bを正常、Aの1秒待機をON（prepare-work）。 **Bだけ遅い**：Bを1秒待機、Aの待機をOFF（simulate-work）。\n\n処理時間は親子で重なります。Aの時間とBの時間を足さないでください。HTTP処理時間グラフには画面・イベント受信も含みます。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "API呼び出し累積回数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, route) (demo_api_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "A起動後の回数。再起動するとリセット。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "APIエラー率（直近1分）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(demo_api_errors_total[1m])) / sum(rate(demo_api_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx率"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "APIエラーを一度も発生させていない場合はNo data。十分なサンプルが集まるまで待ってください。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP処理時間 p95（直近1分）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": "バケットからの近似値。単一リクエストの正確な内訳はトレースで確認。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "HTTP処理時間 平均（直近1分）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "クリック累積回数",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (target) (demo_browser_clicks_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{{target}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "ブラウザ通信時間 平均（直近1分）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (target) (rate(demo_browser_fetch_duration_milliseconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (target) (rate(demo_browser_fetch_duration_milliseconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{target}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "TraceIDの処理内訳（上の入力欄に貼り付け）",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "$traceId",
          "filters": [],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {}
    }
  ]
}
